#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/SVGFormattingContext.cpp (lines 376-609): the paths of <text>
#       and <textPath> (https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/text.html#TextAnchoringProperties), the
#       path, bounding box and SVG transforms of a graphics element, the transform of its
#       nearest transformed ancestor, images, masks, clip paths and patterns laid out as
#       viewports in their content units, and the bounding box of a container element
